Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:14:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: remember the chosen answers difficulty across restarts

A small SharedPreferences-backed settings store (UserSettings, with an in-memory
twin for tests) keeps Normal or Hard, so a player who prefers Hard does not have
to pick it again after every launch. The reminder settings of 1.9 will live in
the same place.

